I was just asked about the issue regarding "unable to load" a library.
If you get this, you most likely do not have the CORRECT GTK+ library for Mountain Lion.
If you have this issue, do the following AFTER step 3 below:

Kill X11 and R

Go to: http://r.research.att.com/#other

Once there, download: GTK_2.24.17-X11.pkg <http://r.research.att.com/libs/GTK_2.24.17-X11.pkg>
Install it
Go to step 5

